  "lanminecraft.universio.quests.act_new_universe.5a78990f2956": "So, all the cards on the table.",
  "lanminecraft.universio.quests.act_new_universe.40caa1608ab6": "&o&4You did this to yourself. you're not an acolite, you wont ever be a keeper. Period.",
  "lanminecraft.universio.quests.act_new_universe.98723492ccbe": "that was your entry into the Trials. complete this and you will graduate as a guardian for our worlds.",
  "lanminecraft.universio.quests.act_new_universe.f2f42af02d37": "&o&4You accepted the call, we never promised anything, but it has it's own perks.",
  "lanminecraft.universio.quests.act_new_universe.5ccf0aed48cf": "Get to work, you need to prove everything before you are allowed anything",
  "lanminecraft.universio.quests.act_new_universe.2792c6bc0533": "Read Me! &5[Lore]",
  "lanminecraft.universio.quests.act_new_universe.d136af829ff7": "We Lied...",
